    rdfs:label "Drosophila sechellia Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm (Holocene, detail scale s0) — Code-to-model traceability: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring and critical_wavenumber cite the Turing formula. Chronospecies comments name Jeong, McGregor, and Chenoweth. The Fourier discretisation is not tied to a numbered equation in a methods paper beyond Turing 1952." ;
